Vendored LMCache native connector headers
=========================================

Upstream: https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache
Tag:     v0.5.3
Commit:  140819c9d57a975dbc5678a6459a218e544cb58b
License: Apache-2.0

These headers are copied from:
  csrc/storage_backends/{connector_base,connector_pybind_utils,
                         connector_interface,connector_types,event_notifier}.h

They are not shipped in the lmcache pip wheel; the upstream example resolves
them from the LMCache source tree. Vendoring locks the C++ ABI for
SurDataConnector builds.

LMCACHE_BIND_CONNECTOR_METHODS is defined in connector_pybind_utils.h.
SurData carries one local safety change in that file: the ``close`` pybind
binding releases the GIL while C++ joins connector workers.

